      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildJavaScript": "",
        "ask": "You are helping a beginner student understand how a card UI is built from data.\n\nExplain how the values passed into a function (like createCard) control what is shown on the card.\n\nFocus on:\n- how each value maps to parts of the card (image, title, description)\n- what one card represents\n- what would change if one value changes\n\nKeep explanations short and clear.",
        "explainCode": "You are helping a beginner student understand how a card UI is built from data.\n\nExplain how the values passed into a function (like createCard) control what is shown on the card.\n\nFocus on:\n- how each value maps to parts of the card (image, title, description)\n- what one card represents\n- what would change if one value changes\n\nKeep explanations short and clear."
      }
    },
    "display_name": "Volunteer Board",
    "bubble_choice_description": "See how a list of volunteer opportunities turns into multiple cards on the page using `.map()`.",
